# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository (Prettier also enforces LF).
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materializes every
# file with CRLF, and `npm run format:check` / `npm run lint:check` then report a
# `Delete ␍` error on every single line — tens of thousands of them. CI never
# sees it because ubuntu-latest checks out LF, so the breakage is invisible until
# someone tries to lint on Windows. Mirrors the frontend repo's .gitattributes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat binary assets as binary so git never touches their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
